text-sm font-medium text-gray-900\">Fast Shopping Cart</h3>\n          <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500\">Look how fast that cart is going. What does this mean for the actual experience? I don&#039;t know.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
